  "description": "Ordered by the king to end a century-long feud between two families, Joo Ha-Yeong is forced to marry Yeon Moo-Eun, a man surrounded by nasty rumors. Surprisingly, after a brief misunderstanding on their wedding night, they quickly form a warm relationship as wife and husband. However, as their bond grows, Ha-Yeong starts questioning the rumors regarding her husband, who hardly seems like the wayward hooligan he is described as. Is Moo-Eun truly a man to be feared? Or is he a man who deserves to be loved?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
